{"term": {"label": "禮", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "7A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/jin-xin-i", "title": "盡心上", "description": "孟子曰：「盡其心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者", "occurrences": 4, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "君子", "id": "君子"}, {"form": "子", "id": "子"}, {"form": "安", "id": "安"}, {"form": "心", "id": "心"}, {"form": "性", "id": "性"}, {"form": "死", "id": "死"}, {"form": "用", "id": "用"}, {"form": "盡", "id": "盡"}, {"form": "禮", "variants": [], "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "聖人", "id": "聖人"}, {"form": "言", "id": "言"}, {"form": "財", "id": "財"}, {"form": "遊", "id": "遊"}, {"form": "門", "id": "門"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.439444275711243, "source": "心", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 2.151762203259462, "source": "心", "target": "盡"}, {"weight": 0.8989992347640942, "source": "心", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.0531499145913523, "source": "心", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 2.151762203259462, "source": "心", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.4586150226995167, "source": "心", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.5276078941864681, "source": "義", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 0.5831462853456169, "source": "義", "target": "君子"}, {"weight": 1.2762934659055623, "source": "義", "target": "性"}, {"weight": 1.6817585740137264, "source": "義", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.662587827025453, "source": "子", "target": "盡"}, {"weight": 2.3749057545736716, "source": "用", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 2.662587827025453, "source": "用", "target": "財"}, {"weight": 2.662587827025453, "source": "用", "target": "安"}, {"weight": 3.355735007585398, "source": "門", "target": "聖人"}, {"weight": 3.068052935133617, "source": "門", "target": "言"}, {"weight": 4.454347296253507, "source": "門", "target": "遊"}, {"weight": 3.068052935133617, "source": "門", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.122142786078304, 